WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A design review summarizes the model, evidence, assumptions, risks and next measurement. The conclusion should match the evidence strength.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
State one conclusion, one supporting result, one limitation and one next test rather than calling a sketch “safe.”

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Oral defense

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

